classDiagram
direction LR
class TranscriptionSettings {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str model
  +str region
  +AuthMode auth_mode
  +AudioRecord audio
  +bool diarization_enabled
  +RecognitionOptions recognition_options
  +EnhancementConfig enhancement
  +bool review_enabled
}
class Draft {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str id
  +TranscriptionSettings config
  +dict form
  +dict summary
  +Path json_base
  +Path document_base
}
class JobConfig {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +int schema_version
  +str job_id
  +str json_directory
  +str document_directory
  +CONFIGURED status
  +True execution_authorized
  +str confirmed_at
}
class ConfirmationReceipt {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str session_id
  +str job_id
  +str config_path
  +AuthMode auth_mode
  +str json_directory
  +str document_directory
  +bool execution_started
}
class SessionConnection {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +int port
  +str token
  +int pid
  +float deadline
}
class SessionTerminal {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +SessionEndState state
  +ConfirmationReceipt_or_None receipt
}
class ExecutionReport {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +str job_id
  +Literal status
  +str cloud_outcome
  +ResultSummary result
  +ErrorReport error
  +ErrorReport record_error
  +DeliveryReport delivery
  +bool documents_ready
  +bool review_enabled
  +dict review
}
class DeliveryReport {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +Literal status
  +str message
  +dict files
  +int export_revision
}
class ReviewDraft {
  <<TypedDict>>
  +int revision
  +str source_sha256
  +list sentences
  +list speakers
  +str_or_None audio_path
}
TranscriptionSettings <|-- JobConfig
Draft --> TranscriptionSettings : 已校验输入
JobConfig ..> ConfirmationReceipt : 交接回执
SessionTerminal --> ConfirmationReceipt : handed_off包含任务回执
JobConfig ..> ExecutionReport : 仅一次执行
ExecutionReport --> DeliveryReport : JSON成功后的文档结果
JobConfig ..> ReviewDraft : 原JSON摘要绑定本机校对
ReviewDraft ..> DeliveryReport : 校验稿另记export_revision
note for Draft "application/session.py<br/>id为预览版本；form保存可恢复输入<br/>预览不含job_id，不在磁盘保存每次编辑<br/>preview_ready登记展示；edit使该版本失效"
note for JobConfig "models.py；utils/job_files.py<br/>继承已校验输入，交接时生成编号与输出路径<br/>配置和SHA发布一次，授权为True<br/>review_enabled为可选字段，旧任务缺失按false；不进入BL参数<br/>Key独立保存在运行目录.env，执行时读取"
note for ConfirmationReceipt "utils/session_files.py<br/>sessions/session_id/receipt.json持久保存对应关系<br/>响应丢失或服务退出后返回同一job_id<br/>execution_started描述交接当时，不是实时进度"
note for SessionTerminal "state为handed_off、expired、cancelled<br/>编辑终态经web.py的SSE发送一次<br/>显式取消结果保存至cancelled.json，响应丢失后可恢复<br/>没有heartbeat或云端状态字段"
note for ExecutionReport "models.py；图中摘录交接与恢复的关键字段<br/>cloud_outcome为not_started、unknown或result_received<br/>result、error、record_error、delivery、review等为可选字段<br/>原稿documents_ready仅在delivery.COMPLETE时为true<br/>job-status另附review的revision、delivery与export_revision"
note for ReviewDraft "application/review.py；jobs/job_id/review/draft.json<br/>同job保留最新改动，未修改时直接使用原JSON<br/>revision只随正文、归属或姓名变化递增<br/>audio_path仅记录重选路径，保存时保持文字版本<br/>导出及关闭不删除草稿；原JSON与配置保持"
note for DeliveryReport "models.py；两类导出复用该协议<br/>原稿记录在delivery/status.json<br/>校验稿记录在review/status.json，另含可选export_revision<br/>各格式仍分别记录READY或FAILED"

note for SessionConnection "utils/session_files.py<br/>私有sessions/session_id/connection.json<br/>端口与令牌用于本机控制；PID与deadline用于残留回收<br/>结束清理后移除；正式交接回执仍保留"
